# Vite build output for frontend/ui and schools/ui — the Dockerfile now
# builds both fresh from source in every image build (see frontend-builder
# stage), so committing the built assets here would just be a second,
# driftable copy that can silently go stale relative to src/.
frontend/static/frontend/
schools/static/schools/